    "content": "<div class=\"ml-en\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">ELI302 · Assessment 4/5</span>\n<h2>Progress Test 3</h2>\n<p class=\"nhan\">Source: FLM syllabus 13743 · assessment table (verbatim)</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">ELI302 · Đầu điểm 4/5</span>\n<h2>Progress Test 3</h2>\n<p class=\"nhan\">Nguồn: syllabus FLM 13743 · bảng đánh giá (nguyên văn)</p></div>\n<div class=\"kv-grid\">\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Type / Loại</span><span class=\"v\">on-going</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Weight / Trọng số</span><span class=\"v\">10.0%</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Parts / Số phần</span><span class=\"v\">1</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Completion criteria / Điều kiện hoàn thành</span><span class=\"v\">&gt;0</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Duration / Thời lượng</span><span class=\"v\">15 minutes/group</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">CLO</span><span class=\"v\">LO7, LO8, LO9</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">No. of questions / Số câu</span><span class=\"v\">N/A</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Knowledge &amp; skill / Kiến thức &amp; kỹ năng</span><span class=\"v\">Test the student's ability to apply knowledge and techniques obtained in the delivered units (Units 7-9) to simultaneous interpreting.</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Grading guide / Hướng dẫn chấm</span><span class=\"v\">In-class test</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Note / Ghi chú</span><span class=\"v\">The teacher shall prepare 5-6 audio files (≈2minutes/file) relating to several specific topics, of which the students will be informed in advance. On the test day, students will be divided into groups of 4 or 5. All members will be standing at different positions in class, simultaneously listening to the same audio and recording their interpretation using a smartphone. Upon completion, students are asked to send the record to the teacher immediately.</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><h3>Sessions in the plan that mention it</h3>\n<ul><li>Session 19 — PROGRESS TEST 1</li><li>Session 20 — PROGRESS TEST 1</li><li>Session 39 — PROGRESS TEST 2</li><li>Session 40 — PROGRESS TEST 2</li><li>Session 53 — PROGRESS TEST 3</li><li>Session 54 — PROGRESS TEST 3</li></ul></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><h3>Buổi trong kế hoạch có nhắc tới</h3>\n<ul><li>Buổi 19 — PROGRESS TEST 1</li><li>Buổi 20 — PROGRESS TEST 1</li><li>Buổi 39 — PROGRESS TEST 2</li><li>Buổi 40 — PROGRESS TEST 2</li><li>Buổi 53 — PROGRESS TEST 3</li><li>Buổi 54 — PROGRESS TEST 3</li></ul></div>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><p class=\"ghi-chu\">No practice paper for this subject in the Exam Room yet.</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><p class=\"ghi-chu\">Phòng thi chưa có đề luyện cho môn này.</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><div class=\"note-ct\">📝 Exam-strategy notes and worked past papers: coming later.</div></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><div class=\"note-ct\">📝 Chiến lược làm bài và chữa đề: sẽ bổ sung sau.</div></div>"
